                                                "text": "Wolowitz: Hang on. There really is a lady here?\nLeonard: Uh-huh.\nWolowitz: And you want us out because you’re anticipating coitus?\nLeonard: No, she’s just a friend.\nWolowitz: So she’s available for coitus?\nLeonard: No, she’s – –"
